# Projection outputs (hub/project.py) and health state. Deliberately NOT tracked:
# design-08 check 3 asserts the manifest's projected sha == main HEAD, so committing
# these would move HEAD past the manifest and make the check fail every single run.
# Leaving them untracked also keeps the tree clean for sync.sh's post-merge guard.
hub/projection-manifest.json
hub/surface-chatgpt.md
hub/surface-claude-ai.md
hub/health-state.json
